0) Go to the ParSim/Vaango/src/StandAlone/UintahUI
   directory.

1) Configure makefile using:

   cmake .

2) Build jar using:

   make

3) Run using

   LD_LIBRARY_PATH=<path_to_parsim>/ParSim/Vaango/src/StandAlone/UintahUI/ThirdParty/lib/amd64/ java -jar UintahUI.jar

For Ubuntu 24.04:

1) Install 3d library:
    sudo apt update && sudo apt install libjava3d-java libjava3d-jni
2) Address modularity issues:
    java \
      --add-exports=java.desktop/sun.awt=ALL-UNNAMED \
      --add-opens=java.desktop/sun.awt.X11=ALL-UNNAMED \
      -Djava.library.path=/usr/lib/jni \
      -jar UintahUI.jar
